# 🌌 NDH‑Constellation Governance Spine v1.4 — Active Edition  
### *Unified‑Provenance‑Grammar v1.0 Compliant*  
### *Seam‑Governance Recognized*  
### *Zen‑Bridge v2.0 Equilibrium‑Aligned*  
### *MERA Dissolution‑Authority Phase — Completed*

This artifact defines the active governance spine for NDH‑Constellation under version 1.4. It supersedes Governance Spine v1.3, incorporates the full provenance grammar, recognizes the updated interface‑governance model introduced by NDH‑Zen‑Bridge v2.0, and stabilizes Constellation‑wide governance behavior under Provenance Snapshot v7.5 and v7.6.

